TalkBack reads the live view as whole phrases — "Recording, 2 minutes 14 seconds", "Camera battery 87 percent", "Waveform, on. Hold for options" — instead of fragments, and assist tools no longer repeat their on-screen abbreviation. Tap and hold both still work. HDR display (Operator Setup → Display) brightens live view, scopes, settings, media and playback on the phone panel; off by default, not the camera's HDR/HLG color mode. Also fixes a start-up failure on Android 15 and newer phones.
